{
  "nl": "两级联动地址管理（单文件组件）：查询有主体名称；表格展示主体名称、省份、所属大区、城市；支持新增、编辑、删除。省份下拉为浙江、广东；表单里「所属大区」自动等于所选省份（取同一套取值，浙江→zj、广东→gd）；「城市」的下拉选项随所属大区变化——浙江出上海/南京，广东出广州/深圳。",
  "nlEn": "Two-level cascading address management (single-file component): query by entity name; the table shows entity name, province, region and city; supports add, edit and delete. The province select offers Zhejiang and Guangdong; in the form the \"region\" is set automatically to the chosen province (same value set: Zhejiang→zj, Guangdong→gd), and the \"city\" options follow the region — Zhejiang gives Shanghai/Nanjing, Guangdong gives Guangzhou/Shenzhen.",
  "fixedFields": [
    "entityName",
    "province",
    "region",
    "city"
  ],
  "pinnedDims": [
    "propSet",
    "actions",
    "reactions:region",
    "reactions:city",
    "mode"
  ],
  "config": {
    "name": "CascadeAddressManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/cascade-addresses",
    "target": "vue3",
    "mode": "sfc",
    "fields": [
      {
        "prop": "entityName",
        "label": "主体名称",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "province",
        "label": "省份",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "浙江",
            "value": "zj"
          },
          {
            "label": "广东",
            "value": "gd"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "region",
        "label": "所属大区",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false,
        "reactions": [
          {
            "dependencies": [
              "province"
            ],
            "fulfill": {
              "value": {
                "var": "province"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "city",
        "label": "城市",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "reactions": [
          {
            "dependencies": [
              "region"
            ],
            "when": {
              "==": [
                {
                  "var": "region"
                },
                "zj"
              ]
            },
            "fulfill": {
              "dataOptions": [
                {
                  "label": "上海",
                  "value": "sh"
                },
                {
                  "label": "南京",
                  "value": "nj"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "dependencies": [
              "region"
            ],
            "when": {
              "==": [
                {
                  "var": "region"
                },
                "gd"
              ]
            },
            "fulfill": {
              "dataOptions": [
                {
                  "label": "广州",
                  "value": "gz"
                },
                {
                  "label": "深圳",
                  "value": "sz"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "AI-07: 级联（region 回写自 province，再由 region 驱动 city 选项）—— 同一遍内 city 读到旧 region，需第二次 watcher 触发才收敛（vue3/SFC）。2026-10-29 修 NL：原文写「华东出上海/南京，华南出广州/深圳」，但 gold 里 region 是纯 Input（值 = province 的取值，zj/gd），**没有任何字段承载 华东/华南**，省份选项也没在 NL 里出现 —— 模型只能自己发明省份（实测写了 华东=east/华南=south），级联随之整条接不上。改 NL 明写省份与取值，并让 city 分支按省份取值陈述：gold 一字未动，这是「NL 必须能推出 gold」的门槛，不是把尺子调歪。"
}
